 happen in Surabaya <br>&gt;Mobilizing mass peoples with ill-weapons in defending Surabaya against superior Allies power and try win the battle of Surabaya which impossible to win.<br>&gt;Morale is important element in this game and you must manage Indonesian's morale in fighting.<br>&gt;Enjoy the music in battle depicting spirit of Indonesian revolution in Surabaya composed by Raden Agung, the experienced Indonesian film composer <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/753a31051e96332b6588d7382db8405a.avif?t=1735115132\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/77d57477b243e9f241bd2ffc3ffee631.poster.avif?t=1735115132\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/77d57477b243e9f241bd2ffc3ffee631.apng?t=1735115132\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/a2f10c88a6dc120492b3828aefe1364b.poster.avif?t=1735115132\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/a2f10c88a6dc120492b3828aefe1364b.apng?t=1735115132\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>TKR /BKR:Tentara Keamanan Rakjat/ Indonesian Solider. This unit have better ability in fighting compare all units. In this game, police include in TKR units.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/a1f4dfa74cc11004748b52ebc624398e.poster.avif?t=1735115132\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/a1f4dfa74cc11004748b52ebc624398e.apng?t=1735115132\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/77a2212ea12a00236821b783175c3d1f.poster.avif?t=1735115132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/77a2212ea12a00236821b783175c3d1f.webm?t=1735115132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Surabayans/Arek-arek: local militia and peoples. This unit in fighting quite good, have large number, but not so good as TKR and Hizbullah. They armed by traditional weapons and guns taken from Japan's arsenal<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/6fefda7f9ec1c93a969c9bb1bcf02048.poster.avif?t=1735115132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/6fefda7f9ec1c93a969c9bb1bcf02048.webm?t=1735115132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/a04edc46f42dc6a4e709a1cb34f8f198.poster.avif?t=1735115132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/a04edc46f42dc6a4e709a1cb34f8f198.webm?t=1735115132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Hizbullah:Hizbullah is Islam special army formed by Japanese military government and Islam's organization. This unit have similiar ability with TKR and have strong spirit, but not so good as TKR.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/2f96b9093985f57036850bdaf33bd7d9.poster.avif?t=1735115132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/2f96b9093985f57036850bdaf33bd7d9.webm?t=1735115132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/f9ea863a4322e0e22b93464b883b79be.poster.avif?t=1735115132\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/f9ea863a4322e0e22b93464b883b79be.apng?t=1735115132\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>Santri: Traditional Islam student. This unit very weak compare another unit since they merely armed by traditional weapons or small guns, but useful carrying wounded soliders to nearest hospital.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/2064d3c6b38c13fbce30123562c01166.poster.avif?t=1735115132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/2064d3c6b38c13fbce30123562c01166.webm?t=1735115132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Tank Go-95: Japanese's light tank. Youths conquered many tanks from Japan's arsenal and militia groups use it for fighting against allies although not so powerful as Sherman and Struat <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/b5bfae6f83bf2054e7bfd1cee87e3ad4.avif?t=1735115132\" /></div><br>Bofors:Anti aircraft machine. There are many anti aircraft types but most powerful is bofors. This unit only show in Inferno arc since militia need this units for shoot the enemy fighters.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/a2ccbb1c15e72c283269af1e9a15ea40.poster.avif?t=1735115132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/a2ccbb1c15e72c283269af1e9a15ea40.webm?t=1735115132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/0e39ea5575ff407d313a10e19becf9b8.poster.avif?t=1735115132\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/0e39ea5575ff407d313a10e19becf9b8.apng?t=1735115132\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>British Troops: Allies troops who have fight in North Africa's and Burma's Campaign. Now after World War II over, they have new mission in Java before return to homeland.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/8f33f4076874362e9efd11afa76553ae.poster.avif?t=1735115132\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/8f33f4076874362e9efd11afa76553ae.apng?t=1735115132\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/a97ae743405d67f205d1df9dbd63de15.poster.avif?t=1735115132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/a97ae743405d67f205d1df9dbd63de15.webm?t=1735115132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Indian Troops: Allies troops from India who have fight in North Africa's and Burma's Campaign. Now after World War II over, they have new mission in Java before return to home. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/4bd7d717b0ddfca3d56e83789549e3c6.poster.avif?t=1735115132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/4bd7d717b0ddfca3d56e83789549e3c6.webm?t=1735115132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Sherman Tank:British's medium tank. Very strong to protect British's company against Indonesian militia attack<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/50aa74f528bfbacfb5f107a1310d6faf.poster.avif?t=1735115132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/50aa74f528bfbacfb5f107a1310d6faf.webm?t=1735115132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Struat Tank:British's light tank. Not strong like Sherman, but still strong to defending British's company against Indonesian.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/50aa74f528bfbacfb5f107a1310d6faf.poster.avif?t=1735115132\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/50aa74f528bfbacfb5f107a1310d6faf.webm?t=1735115132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Japanese troops: After World War II over, Japanese troops not so strong as before and they become target for Indonesian for revenge or weapons.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/8d42b0fa7499148a297fb152732587c6.avif?t=1735115132\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/5c393c601ad557f625754888c7eb312b.avif?t=1735115132\" /></div><br>Consolidation is a story set in 26 September to 3 October 1945 at the time Surabayans/Arek-Arek  Suroboyo attack and seized many Japanese headquarters in Surabaya in order get many arms for defending the independence.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/c9d72a0c129fb8d6b64b992f9dcba1ec.avif?t=1735115132\" /></div><br>Fighting Cock is a story set in 28 October 1945 when a large number of Surabayans attacking many Allies' post in Surabaya after British and Indian troops landed, established many strategic posts in Surabaya, and demand disarm all Surabayans.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1393810/extras/4c83cd0ae7b0c4ebdede52770b43ac26.avif?t=1735115132\" /></div><br>Inferno is a story set on 10 November 1945 when Surabayans and the government rejected the ultimatum delivered by the Allies to disarm and surrender follows murdered of Brigadier Mallaby by Indonesian. In this last arc, Surabayans faced large attack from land, sea, and air while the large number of Surabayans defending city  as long as possible.<br><br><br><strong>Note:</strong><br>Previous version, Surabaya Inferno used lot of historical painting painted by M.Sochieb. and Sutuomo's speech. Until now, we still use achivements image from M.Sochieb painting. Total nett revenue share , 20% will share to veterans while 80% go to Sengkala.",
    "short_description": "Freedom or Death! Surabaya Inferno is a real-time tactics game based on the battle of Surabaya which occured at November 10th, 1945. Play as Surabayans fighting against the forces of Britain, Netherlands, and Japan in order to defend their independence in Indonesia!",
